#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The standard does not specify the directory that B<tmpfile>()  will use.  "
#| "Glibc will try the path prefix I<P_tmpdir> defined in I<E<lt>stdio."
#| "hE<gt>>, and if that fails the directory I</tmp>."
msgid ""
"The standard does not specify the directory that B<tmpfile>()  will use.  "
"glibc will try the path prefix I<P_tmpdir> defined in I<E<lt>stdio.hE<gt>>, "
"and if that fails, then the directory I</tmp>."
msgstr ""
"El estándar no especifica el directorio que será usado por B<tmpfile>().  "
"Glibc probará con el prefijo de ruta I<P_tmpdir> definido en I<E<lt>stdio."
"hE<gt>>, y si ésto falla el directorio I</tmp>."

